# Cloudflare Pages: serve index.html for every path, with a 200 rather than a
# redirect, so the SPA's router handles the URL.
#
# Without this, a student who refreshes mid-exam — or whose browser reloads the
# tab after a crash — gets a 404 from the CDN instead of the app, and the
# resume path (restore from IndexedDB, re-enter the paper) never runs. That is
# the one failure this file exists to prevent, so it ships with the app rather
# than being set in the dashboard where it can be forgotten.
/*    /index.html   200
